{
  "category": "Thorn Pokémon",
  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "ROSELIA shoots sharp thorns as projectiles at any opponent that tries to steal the flowers on its arms. The aroma of this POKéMON brings serenity to living things.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "On extremely rare occasions, a ROSELIA is said to appear with its flowers in unusual colors. The thorns on this POKéMON’s head contain a vicious poison.",
      "version": "sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "A ROSELIA that drinks nutritionally rich springwater blooms with lovely flowers. The fragrance of its flowers has the effect of making its foes careless.",
      "version": "emerald"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its flowers give off a relaxing fragrance. The stronger its aroma, the healthier the ROSELIA is.",
      "version": "firered"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its flowers give off a relaxing fragrance. The stronger its aroma, the healthier the ROSELIA is.",
      "version": "leafgreen"
    },
    {
      "text": "ROSELIA raised on clean drinking water are known to grow vividly colored flowers.",
      "version": "diamond"
    },
    {
      "text": "The beautiful flowers on its arms have toxic thorns. Don’t even think about picking those flowers.",
      "version": "pearl"
    },
    {
      "text": "The more healthy the ROSELIA, the more pleasant its flowers’ aroma. Its scent deeply relaxes people.",
      "version": "platinum"
    },
    {
      "text": "ROSELIA that drink nutritionally rich springwater are said to reveal rare coloration when they bloom.",
      "version": "heartgold"
    },
    {
      "text": "ROSELIA that drink nutritionally rich springwater are said to reveal rare coloration when they bloom.",
      "version": "soulsilver"
    },
    {
      "text": "The more healthy the Roselia, the more pleasant its flowers’ aroma. Its scent deeply relaxes people.",
      "version": "black"
    },
    {
      "text": "The more healthy the Roselia, the more pleasant its flowers’ aroma. Its scent deeply relaxes people.",
      "version": "white"
    },
    {
      "text": "It uses the different poisons in each hand separately when it attacks. The stronger its aroma, the healthier it is.",
      "version": "black-2"
    },
    {
      "text": "It uses the different poisons in each hand separately when it attacks. The stronger its aroma, the healthier it is.",
      "version": "white-2"
    },
    {
      "text": "It uses the different poisons in each hand separately when it attacks. The stronger its aroma, the healthier it is.",
      "version": "x"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roselia that drink nutritionally rich springwater are said to reveal rare coloration when they bloom.",
      "version": "y"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roselia shoots sharp thorns as projectiles at any opponent that tries to steal the flowers on its arms. The aroma of this Pokémon brings serenity to living things.",
      "version": "omega-ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "On extremely rare occasions, a Roselia is said to appear with its flowers in unusual colors. The thorns on this Pokémon’s head contain a vicious poison.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its flowers give off a relaxing fragrance. The stronger its aroma, the healthier the Roselia is.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "It uses the different poisons in each hand separately when it attacks. The stronger its aroma, the healthier it is.",
      "version": "shield"
    },
    {
      "text": "Though beautiful, it has highly poisonous thorns. There is an old tradition in my homeland wherein one would send these thorns to an opponent to challenge them to a duel.",
      "version": "legends-arceus"
    }
  ],
